  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2602.07 Consumer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2602.07 “Consumer” means a person who is the final user of products, or both, purchased from a retail establishment. The term does not include anyone who is hired, contracted or compensated in any manner, or donates their services.\n\nSource. #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15",
